  "question": {
    "text": "<p>What is the energy stored in the capacitor (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>μJ</mi></math> ) between terminals <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>'</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>'</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>'</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>'</mo></math> of the network (as shown in figure)?If capacitance of each capacitor is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mi>μF</mi></math>.</p>\r\r<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0117_1374de9da36d.png\" style=\"width: 151px; height: 116px;\" /></p>\r"
  },
